get manager is on":[""],"The widget manager is off":[""],"Unchecked widgets are removed from the Dashboard.":[""],"Every widget shows on the Dashboard.":[""],"Widget Visibility":["Widget l\u00e1that\u00f3s\u00e1ga"],"Control which widgets appear on your WordPress dashboard. Core and WooCommerce widgets are enabled by default.":[""],"No widgets discovered yet. Visit the Dashboard once so the plugin can detect them.":[""],"The menu manager is on":[""],"The menu manager is off":[""],"Unchecked items are removed from the admin sidebar.":[""],"Every menu item shows in the admin sidebar.":[""],"Menu Visibility":[""],"Control which menu items appear in the admin sidebar. Protected items (Dashboard, Settings, Plugins, LW Plugins) cannot be hidden.":[""],"No menu items discovered yet. Enable the feature and visit any admin page.":[""],"The admin bar manager is on":[""],"The admin bar manager is off":[""],"Unchecked items are removed from the admin bar.":[""],"Every item shows in the admin bar.":[""],"Admin Bar Visibility":[""],"Control which items appear in the WordPress admin bar. Protected items (My Account, Logout) cannot be hidden.":[""],"No admin bar items discovered yet. Enable the feature and visit any page.":[""],"Open the Dashboard":[""],"Detection only runs while the manager is on and saved.":[""],"The manager is off, so these choices do not apply yet. They are kept and take effect once you turn it on and save.":[""]}}}